   "source": [
    "- Implements a Greedy Nearest-Neighbor TSP (Traveling Salesperson Problem) algorithm.\n",
    "- Calculates the shortest delivery route starting from a pharmacy and visiting all assigned customers.\n",
    "- Considers the rider's speed to compute travel time dynamically.\n",
    "- Ensures that delivery times are minimized for each batch of orders."
   ]
